<title>USA: WHG stake cut by Jerome Davis to 6.22 pct.</title>
<headline>WHG stake cut by Jerome Davis to 6.22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investor Jerome Davis said Thursday he has reduced his stake in WHG Bancshares Corp to 91,048 shares or 6.22 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Davis and his wife said they sold 70,085 shares  in transactions on March 26 and April 18 at $14.19 and $14.50 each.</p>
